window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Who knew chasing immortality would be so hard?</b></p> <p>To keep her human friend from being turned by her overzealous vampire mate, Phaedra has to find an artifact that grants its owner eternity. But her former partner turned leech insists on inserting himself into the search, and he's got a surprise for her: She's his mate.</p> <p>There's no way this Fae warrior is tying herself to a vamp forever, but escaping him is as easy is flying on broken wings. And that's not the only shock she's in for. A leech for a mate is bad enough, but a vampire sibling… Fangs don't belong in her family, right?</p> <p><b>Fae Wilds Series</b></p> <ul> <li>Twist &amp; Turns</li> <li>Curse of the Fae</li> <li>Force the Truth</li> <li>Crown &amp; Glory</li> <li>Enemy &amp; Rivals</li> <li>Light in the Dark</li> <li>Dusk and Shadows</li> <li>Called by Midnight</li> <li>Dark Memories</li> <li>Above the Curse</li> <li>Myths and Muses</li> <li>Chase and Hunt</li> </ul> <p><i>USA Today Bestselling Author, W.J. May creates a new paranormal series with a world of Fae and Magic. Escape into a realm of fantasy creatures, love and deception, betrayal and jealousy. A coming of age paranormal mini part series that'll keep you listening late into the night!</i></p>"; 
